orm that connects to your bank, automatically categorizes transactions for tax, and generates A..."},"definition":{"en":"BrickTrack is an Australian property investment tracking platform that connects to your bank, automatically categorizes transactions for tax, and generates ATO-ready reports."},"features":{"zh":["连接银行","自动分类交易","生成ATO报告","使用Next.js和React构建","支持Open Banking","使用PostgreSQL和drizzle-orm进行数据存储"],"ja":["銀行に接続","取引を自動で分類","ATOレポートを生成","Next.jsとReactを使用して構築","Open Bankingをサポート","PostgreSQLとdrizzle-ormを使用してデータを保存"],"ko":["은행에 연결","거래를 자동으로 분류","ATO 보고서를 생성","Next.js와 React를 사용하여 구축","Open Banking을 지원","PostgreSQL과 drizzle-orm을 사용하여 데이터를 저장"],"es":["Conexión con bancos australianos","Categorización automática de transacciones","Generación de informes listos para la ATO","Integración con tecnologías como React y Next.js","Utiliza PostgreSQL como base de datos","Desarrollado con TypeScript y Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Connexion aux banques australiennes","Catégorisation automatique des transactions","Génération de rapports prêts pour l''ATO","Intégration avec des technologies comme React et Next.js","Utilise PostgreSQL comme base de données","Développé avec TypeScript et Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Verbindung mit australischen Banken","Automatische Kategorisierung von Transaktionen","Generierung von ATO-bereiten Berichten","Integration mit Technologien wie React und Next.js","Verwendung von PostgreSQL als Datenbank","Entwickelt mit TypeScript und Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Conexão ao banco para rastreamento de transações","Categorização automática de transações para impostos","Geração de relatórios prontos para a ATO","Utilização de tecnologias de IA e open-banking","Desenvolvido com NextJS, React e TailwindCSS"],"ru":["Подключение к банку для отслеживания транзакций","Автоматическая категоризация транзакций для налогов","Генерация отчетов, готовых для ATO","Использование технологий ИИ и open-banking","Разработан с использованием NextJS, React и TailwindCSS"],"ar":["التوصّل بالبنك لتسجيل المعاملات","تصنيف تلقائي للمعاملات للضرائب","إنشاء تقارير جاهزة للهيئة الأسترالية للضرائب","استخدام تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي والبنوك المفتوحة","تم تطويره باستخدام NextJS و React و TailwindCSS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用ralph-execute AI智能代理","什么是Open Banking","ralph-execute AI智能代理安装","Next.js和React开发","PostgreSQL和drizzle-orm教程","澳大利亚房产投资跟踪工具","ATO报告生成"],"ja":["ralph-execute AIエージェントの使用方法","Open Bankingとは","ralph-execute AIエージェントのインストール","Next.jsとReactの開発","PostgreSQLとdrizzle-ormのチュートリアル","オーストラリアの不動産投資トラッキングツール","ATOレポートの生成"],"ko":["ralph-execute AI 에이전트 사용 방법","Open Banking이란","ralph-execute AI 에이전트 설치","Next.js와 React 개발","PostgreSQL과 drizzle-orm 튜토리얼","호주 부동산 투자 추적 도구","ATO 보고서 생성"],"es":["herramientas de AI para inversión inmobiliaria","ralph-execute alternativa","cómo usar ralph-execute","guía de instalación de ralph-execute","configuración de ralph-execute"," BrickTrack vs competidores","desarrollo de aplicaciones con React y Next.js","uso de PostgreSQL en aplicaciones"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour investissement immobilier","ralph-execute alternative","comment utiliser ralph-execute","guide d''installation de ralph-execute","configuration de ralph-execute","BrickTrack vs concurrents","développement d''applications avec React et Next.js","utilisation de PostgreSQL dans les applications"],"de":["KI-Tools für Immobilieninvestitionen","ralph-execute Alternative","wie man ralph-execute verwendet","Installationsanleitung für ralph-execute","Konfiguration von ralph-execute","BrickTrack vs Wettbewerber","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit React und Next.js","Verwendung von PostgreSQL in Anwendungen"],"pt":["como usar ralph-execute","o que é ralph-execute","ralph-execute alternativa","ralph-execute vs outros","instalar ralph-execute","guia de configuração do ralph-execute","desenvolvimento de aplicativos de investimentos imobiliários"],"ru":["как использовать ralph-execute","что такое ralph-execute","альтернативы ralph-execute","ralph-execute vs другие","установка ralph-execute","руководство по настройке ralph-execute","разработка приложений для отслеживания инвестиций в недвижимость"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ralph-execute","ما هو ralph-execute","بديل ralph-execute","ralph-execute مقابل غيره","تثبيت ralph-execute","دليل إعداد ralph-execute","تطوير تطبيقات لاستثمار العقارات"]}},"owner":"ItsMattG","repo":"property-tracker","repoPath":"ItsMattG/property-tracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T22:10:01Z","topics":["ai","australia","drizzle-orm","fintech","nextjs","open-banking","postgresql","property-investment","react","saas","tailwindcss","trpc","typescript"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph-execute","description":"Autonomous execution loop that processes a Beads epic task-by-task with fresh subagents, two-stage review, and circuit breaker safety. Use after plan-to-epic creates the epic.","bodyPreview":"# Ralph Execute — Autonomous Epic Runner\n\nProcess a Beads epic autonomously, dispatching fresh subagents per task with two-stage review gates.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- First argument: Beads epic ID (required)\n- `--dry-run`: Show what would execute without doing it (optional)\n\n## Pre-Flight Checks\n\nBefore starting the loop:\n\n1. **Verify epic exists**: `bd show <epic-id>`\n2. **Check ready tasks**: `bd ready --parent <epic-id>` — must have at least one\n3. **Verify worktree**: Must be in a worktree, not mai","body":"# Ralph Execute — Autonomous Epic Runner\n\nProcess a Beads epic autonomously, dispatching fresh subagents per task with two-stage review gates.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- First argument: Beads epic ID (required)\n- `--dry-run`: Show what would execute without doing it (optional)\n\n## Pre-Flight Checks\n\nBefore starting the loop:\n\n1. **Verify epic exists**: `bd show <epic-id>`\n2. **Check ready tasks**: `bd ready --parent <epic-id>` — must have at least one\n3. **Verify worktree**: Must be in a worktree, not main repo (enforced by block-work-on-develop hook)\n4. **Initialize circuit breaker**: `.claude/hooks/circuit-breaker.sh reset`\n5. **Create session marker**: `mkdir -p .ralph-session/questions .ralph-session/answers .ralph-session/messages`\n6. **Notify start**: Send ntfy notification \"Ralph starting epic <id>\"\n7. **Set phase to IMPLEMENT**: If `.claude/phases/output/current-phase.json` exists and `current_phase` is not `implement`, update it:\n   ```bash\n   PHASE_FILE=\".claude/phases/output/current-phase.json\"\n   if [[ -f \"$PHASE_FILE\" ]]; then\n     python3 -c \"\n   import json\n   with open(''$PHASE_FILE'') as f: state = json.load(f)\n   if state.get(''current_phase'') != ''implement'':\n       completed = state.get(''completed_phases'', [])\n       if state.get(''current_phase'') and state[''current_phase''] not in completed:\n           completed.append(state[''current_phase''])\n       state[''current_phase''] = ''implement''\n       state[''completed_phases''] = completed\n       with open(''$PHASE_FILE'', ''w'') as f: json.dump(state, f, indent=2)\n   \"\n   fi\n   ```\n   If no phase file exists, create one:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p .claude/phases/output\n   echo ''{\"topic\":\"<epic-name>\",\"current_phase\":\"implement\",\"completed_phases\":[\"research\",\"plan\"],\"output_files\":{}}'' > \"$PHASE_FILE\"\n   ```\n\n## Execution Loop\n\nFor each task from `bd ready --parent <epic-id>`:\n\n### Step A: Claim Task\n```bash\nbd update <task-id> --status in_progress\n```\n\nLog activity and update monitor:\n```bash\necho \"[$(date +%H:%M)] Task <task-id> started: <title>\" >> .ralph-session/ralph.log\n.claude/hooks/circuit-breaker.sh write-status \"<task-id>\" \"<title>\" <total> <completed> <mode>\n```\n\n### Step A.5: Plan Pass (First Iteration Only)\n\nFor the FIRST iteration of each task, run a gap analysis:\n\n```bash\n.claude/hooks/generate-prompt.sh <task-id> .ralph-session/PROMPT.md plan\n```\n\nDispatch a read-only subagent (model: haiku) with the plan-mode PROMPT.md.\nThe subagent writes findings to `.ralph-session/gap-analysis.md`.\n\n**Validate plan pass output:**\nAfter the plan subagent completes, verify `.ralph-session/gap-analysis.md` exists and has content:\n```bash\nif [[ ! -f \".ralph-session/gap-analysis.md\" ]] || [[ $(wc -w < \".ralph-session/gap-analysis.md\") -lt 20 ]]; then\n  echo \"[Ralph] Plan pass failed — no gap analysis produced\" >> .ralph-session/ralph.log\n  .claude/hooks/circuit-breaker.sh record-failure\n  # Skip to next task\n  continue\nfi\n```\n\nRead the gap analysis before proceeding to build mode. Use it to inform\nthe implementation subagent''s context.\n\n### Step B: Generate PROMPT.md\n```bash\n.claude/hooks/generate-prompt.sh <task-id> .ralph-session/PROMPT.md build\n```\n\n### Step C: Check Circuit Breaker\n```bash\n.claude/hooks/circuit-breaker.sh check\n```\nIf PAUSED — stop loop, notify human, exit.\nIf DEGRADED — wait 30 seconds (`sleep 30`) as a backoff, then continue.\n\n### Step D: Dispatch Subagent\n\nLaunch a Task subagent with the PROMPT.md content. The subagent:\n- Reads the generated PROMPT.md\n- Implements the task following the rules\n- Runs verification commands (test, lint, typecheck)\n- Outputs `RALPH_COMPLETE` when done\n- Writes completion signal: `echo \"RALPH_COMPLETE\" > .ralph-session/completion-signal`\n\n### Step D.5: Handle Escalation\n\nAfter the subagent returns, check if it escalated:\n\n**If result contains `ESCALATE:`:**\n1. Read the question file:\n   ```bash\n   cat .ralph-session/questions/<task-id>.json\n   ```\n2. Log the escalation:\n   ```bash\n   echo \"[$(date +%H:%M)] Task <task-id> ESCALATED: <summary>\" >> .ralph-session/ralph.log\n   ```\n3. Ask the user the question directly in your response text. Include the full question, context, and options from the JSON file.\n4. Write the user''s answer to `.ralph-session/answers/<task-id>.json`:\n   ```json\n   {\"task_id\":\"<task-id>\",\"answer\":\"<user''s response>\",\"timestamp\":\"<iso>\"}\n   ```\n5. **Dispatch a new subagent** with a Task call that includes the user''s answer in the prompt context, along with the original task description and any partial work from `.ralph-session/`.\n6. After the new subagent completes, proceed to Step E as normal.\n\n**If result contains `RALPH_COMPLETE`:**\nProceed to Step E.\n\n**If result contains neither:**\nThe subagent may have failed silently. Record failure and proceed:\n```bash\n.claude/hooks/circuit-breaker.sh record-failure\necho \"[$(date +%H:%M)] Task <task-id> returned without completion signal\" >> .ralph-session/ralph.log\n```\n\n### Step E: Two-Stage Review\n\n**Stage 1 — Spec Compliance:**\nLaunch a review subagent that compares the code changes against the task description.\nCheck: Does the implementation match what was requested? Any missing requirements?\n\n**Stage 2 — Code Quality:**\nLaunch the code-reviewer agent (`.claude/agents/code-reviewer.md`).\nCheck: Anti-patterns, security, test coverage, conventions.\n\n### Step F: Handle Review Results\n\n**If both pass:**\n```bash\n.claude/hooks/circuit-breaker.sh record-success\nbd close <task-id>\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://ntfy.sh/property-tracker-claude\" \\\n  -d \"Task <task-id> complete\" -H \"Title: Ralph Progress\"\n```\nClean up: `rm -f .ralph-session/completion-signal`\n\nLog completion:\n```bash\necho \"[$(date +%H:%M)] Task <task-id> completed (pass@1)\" >> .ralph-session/ralph.log\n```\n\n**If either fails:**\n```bash\n.claude/hooks/circuit-breaker.sh record-failure\n```\nDispatch a fix subagent with the review feedback. Then re-run Step E.\nMax 3 fix attempts per task (enforced by circuit breaker).\n\n### Step F.5: Record to eval-tracker\n\nAfter each task resolution (pass or max-attempts-exceeded), append to `.claude/instincts/eval-tracker.jsonl`:\n\n```bash\necho \"{\\\"task_id\\\":\\\"<task-id>\\\",\\\"epic_id\\\":\\\"<epic-id>\\\",\\\"attempts\\\":1,\\\"fix_attempts\\\":<N>,\\\"passed\\\":<true|false>,\\\"date\\\":\\\"$(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ)\\\",\\\"branch\\\":\\\"$(git branch --show-current)\\\",\\\"duration_sec\\\":<elapsed>,\\\"skill_context\\\":[\\\"<instinct-id-1>\\\",\\\"<instinct-id-2>\\\"]}\" >> .claude/instincts/eval-tracker.jsonl\n```\n\nWhere:\n- `attempts`: always 1 (one dispatch per task)\n- `fix_attempts`: 0 if passed on first try, 1-3 for fix iterations\n- `passed`: true if eventually passed review, false if max attempts exceeded\n- `duration_sec`: wall-clock seconds from dispatch to completion\n- `skill_context`: array of instinct IDs that were active (injected via `{{LEARNED_PATTERNS}}`) when this task was dispatched. Enables `/eval-report` Step 4 to measure per-instinct effectiveness.\n\n### Step G: Next Task\n\nLoop back to Step A with the next `bd ready --parent <epic-id>` task.\n\n## Exit Conditions\n\nThe loop exits when ANY of these are true:\n1. `bd ready --parent <epic-id>` returns no tasks (epic complete)\n2. Circuit breaker enters PAUSED state\n3. User manually creates `.ralph-session/STOP` file\n\n## Cleanup\n\nOn exit (success or circuit breaker), save summary before deleting session evidence:\n```bash\n# Preserve session summary for post-mortem analysis\nmkdir -p .claude/agent-memory/ralph\nif [[ -f .ralph-session/circuit-breaker.json ]]; then\n  cp .ralph-session/circuit-breaker.json \".claude/agent-memory/ralph/session-$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S).json\"\nfi\nrm -rf .ralph-session\n```\n\n**Phase Advance (auto):**\nAfter all tasks complete (not on PAUSED exit):\n```bash\nPHASE_FILE=\".claude/phases/output/current-phase.json\"\nTOPIC=$(python3 -c \"import json; print(json.load(open(''$PHASE_FILE'')).get(''topic'',''unknown''))\" 2>/dev/null)\n\n# Run checkpoint evaluation\nCHECKPOINT_RESULT=$(.claude/hooks/checkpoint-eval.sh implement review \"$TOPIC\" 2>&1)\nCHECKPOINT_EXIT=$?\n\nif [[ \"$CHECKPOINT_EXIT\" -eq 0 ]]; then\n  python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open(''$PHASE_FILE'') as f: state = json.load(f)\nstate[''completed_phases''] = list(set(state.get(''completed_phases'', []) + [''implement'']))\nstate[''current_phase''] = ''review''\nwith open(''$PHASE_FILE'', ''w'') as f: json.dump(state, f, indent=2)\n\"\n  echo \"Phase advanced to REVIEW\"\nelse\n  echo \"Phase remains IMPLEMENT — checkpoint failed: $CHECKPOINT_RESULT\"\nfi\n```\n\nOn PAUSED exit, do NOT advance phase — user intervention needed.\n\nSend final notification:\n```bash\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://ntfy.sh/property-tracker-claude\" \\\n  -d \"Ralph finished epic <id>. Status: <complete|paused>\" \\\n  -H \"Title: Ralph Done\" -H \"Priority: high\"\nosascript -e ''display notification \"Ralph finished\" with title \"Claude Code\"''\n```\n\n## Safety Guarantees\n\n- All 17 existing hooks remain active (lint, anti-patterns, security, auth checks)\n- Circuit breaker prevents infinite loops (max 3 failures per task, max 5 iterations without progress)\n- Fresh subagent per task prevents context pollution\n- Two-stage review catches both spec drift and quality issues\n- ntfy notifications on every state change\n\n## Language Patterns (From Ghuntley Research)\n\nWhen generating PROMPT.md, these language patterns improve subagent performance:\n- \"Study\" not \"read\" or \"look at\" — triggers deeper analysis\n- \"Don''t assume not implemented\" — prevents hallucinated code\n- \"Using parallel subagents\" — explicit parallelism instruction\n- \"Only 1 subagent for build/tests\" — enforces backpressure\n- \"Capture the why\" — documentation emphasis\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T04:13:40.338Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Autonomous Agents needing to process Beads epics with two-stage review gates and dispatch subagents per task.","zh":"适合需要处理带有两个阶段审查门的Beads史诗并根据任务调度子代理的自主代理。","ja":"2段階のレビューゲートを備えたBeadsエピックを処理し、タスクごとにサブエージェントを派遣する自律エージェントに適しています。","ko":"2단계 검토 게이트가 있는 Beads 에픽을 처리하고 작업별로 하위 에이전트를 디스패치하는 자율 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Autónomos que necesitan procesar epics de Beads con puertas de revisión de dos etapas y enviar subagentes por tarea.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Autonomes ayant besoin de traiter des epics Beads avec des portes de révision à deux étapes et d''envoyer des sous-agents par tâche.","de":"Ideal für autonome Agenten, die Beads-Epics mit zweistufigen Überprüfungstoren verarbeiten und Unteragenten pro Aufgabe entsenden müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Autônomos que precisam processar epics Beads com portões de revisão em duas etapas e enviar subagentes por tarefa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, которым необходимо обработать эпические бусины с двусторонними ворота обзора и отправить субагентов на задачу.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مستقل يحتاج إلى معالجة حبات الملابس بطريقة المراجعة مرحلتين وإرسال وكلاء فرعيين لكل مهمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to autonomously execute Beads epics, utilizing `bd show` and `bd ready` commands for pre-flight checks, and enabling efficient task management with optional `--dry-run` mode for testing.","zh":"赋予代理自主执行Beads史诗的能力，利用`bd show`和`bd ready`命令进行预检，并通过可选的`--dry-run`模式实现高效的任务管理以进行测试。","ja":"エージェントにBeadsエピックを自律的に実行する能力を与え、`bd show`および`bd ready`コマンドを使用した事前チェックを行い、テスト用に`--dry-run`モードによる効率的なタスク管理を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Beads 에픽을 tự주적으로 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고 `bd show` 및 `bd ready` 명령을 사용한 사전 확인을 수행하며 테스트를 위한 `--dry-run` 모드를 사용한 효율적인 작업 관리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar autónomamente epics de Beads, utilizando los comandos `bd show` y `bd ready` para controles previos al vuelo, y habilitando una gestión de tareas eficiente con el modo `--dry-run` opcional para pruebas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter de manière autonome des epics Beads, en utilisant les commandes `bd show` et `bd ready` pour les vérifications pré-vol, et en permettant une gestion de tâches efficace avec le mode `--dry-run` facultatif pour les tests.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Beads-Epics autonom auszuführen, indem sie die Befehle `bd show` und `bd ready` für Vorab-Checks verwenden und eine effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung mit dem optionalen `--dry-run`-Modus für Tests ermöglichen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes executem epics Beads de forma autônoma, utilizando comandos `bd show` e `bd ready` para verificações de pré-voo e habilitando gerenciamento de tarefas eficiente com modo `--dry-run` opcional para testes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автономного выполнения эпических бусин, используя команды `bd show` и `bd ready` для предполетных проверок и ermögляя эффективное управление задачами с опциональным режимом `--dry-run` для тестирования.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل حبات الملابس بطريقة مستقلة، باستخدام أوامر `bd show` و `bd ready` للتحقق من الطيران المسبق، وتتمكن من إدارة المهام بشكل فعال مع وضع `--dry-run` الاختياري للاختبار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating epic execution with fresh subagent dispatching","Streamlining task management with two-stage review gates","Testing epic execution with `--dry-run` mode"],"zh":["使用新鲜的子代理调度自动执行史诗","使用两阶段审查门流线型任务管理","使用`--dry-run`模式测试史诗执行"],"ja":["新しいサブエージェントのディスパッチを使用したエピックの自動実行","2段階のレビューゲートを使用したタスク管理のストリーミング","`--dry-run`モードを使用したエピック実行のテスト"],"ko":["새로운 하위 에이전트 디스패치를 사용한 에픽 자동 실행","2단계 검토 게이트를 사용한 작업 관리 스트리밍","`--dry-run` 모드를 사용한 에픽 실행 테스트"],"es":["Automatización de la ejecución de epics con envío de subagentes frescos","Optimización de la gestión de tareas con puertas de revisión de dos etapas","Pruebas de ejecución de epics con modo `--dry-run`"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''exécution d''epics avec envoi de sous-agents frais","Optimisation de la gestion de tâches avec des portes de révision à deux étapes","Tests d''exécution d''epics avec le mode `--dry-run`"],"de":["Automatisierung der Ausführung von Epics mit Versand von frischen Unteragenten","Optimierung der Aufgabenverwaltung mit zweistufigen Überprüfungstoren","Tests der Epic-Ausführung im `--dry-run`-Modus"],"pt":["Automatizar a execução de epics com envio de subagentes frescos","Otimizar o gerenciamento de tarefas com portões de revisão em duas etapas","Testar a execução de epics com modo `--dry-run`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выполнение эпиков с отправкой свежих субагентов","Оптимизировать управление задачами с двусторонними воротами обзора","Тестировать выполнение эпиков в режиме `--dry-run`"],"ar":["أتمتة تشغيل حبات الملابس بإرسال وكلاء فرعيين جدد","جعل إدارة المهام أكثر كفاءة باستخدام بوابات المراجعة مرحلتين","اختبار تشغيل حبات الملابس في وضع `--dry-run`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Beads epic ID","Must be in a worktree environment","Dependent on `bd` command-line tool"],"zh":["需要Beads史诗ID","必须在工作树环境中","依赖于`bd`命令行工具"],"ja":["BeadsエピックIDが必要","ワークツリ環境内でなければならない","`bd`コマンドラインツールに依存"],"ko":["Beads 에픽 ID가 필요","작업 트리 환경에서 여야 함","`bd` 명령줄 도구에 종속"],"es":["Requiere ID de epic de Beads","Debe estar en un entorno de worktree","Dependiente de la herramienta de línea de comandos `bd`"],"fr":["Nécessite un ID d''epic Beads","Doit être dans un environnement de worktree","Dépend de l''outil de ligne de commande `bd`"],"de":["Benötigt Beads-Epic-ID","Muss in einer Worktree-Umgebung sein","Abhängig von dem Befehlszeilen-Tool `bd`"],"pt":["Requer ID de epic Beads","Deve estar em um ambiente de worktree","Dependente da ferramenta de linha de comando `bd`"],"ru":["Требует идентификатора эпического бусины","Должен находиться в среде worktree","Зависит от командной строки инструмента `bd`"],"ar":["يتطلب معرف حبة الملابس","يجب أن يكون في بيئة شجرة العمل","يعتمد على أداة سطر الأوامر `bd`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9cc152b02b9d5bbec617896d59913d27232bfbfce5fd1ce6d569d502bdaf627e","qualityScore":57}');
