ات الذكية ذاتية التشغيل مع مساعدة الوكلاء الذكية","الحلقات التكرارية لجيفري هانتلي","التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات","سياق جديد في كل تكرار","منع 溢出 وتراجع السياق"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use ralph-wiggum","what is ralph-wiggum","ralph-wiggum alternative","ralph-wiggum vs spec-driven development","ralph-wiggum install","ralph-wiggum setup guide","autonomous AI coding with ralph-wiggum","spec-driven development with ralph-wiggum","geoffrey huntley''s iterative bash loop"],"zh":["Ralph Wiggum","自主AI编码","spec-driven开发","Geoffrey Huntley","迭代bash循环","AI编码工具","自动化开发"],"ja":["Ralph Wiggum","自動AIコーディング","spec-driven開発","Geoffrey Huntley","イテレーティブbashループ","AIコーディングツール","自動化開発"],"ko":["Ralph Wiggum","자율적 AI 코딩","spec-driven 개발","Geoffrey Huntley","반복 bash 루프","AI 코딩 도구","자동화 개발"],"es":["Ralph Wiggum","desarrollo de software autónomo","herramientas de IA para desarrollo","iteración bash","desarrollo orientado a especificaciones","proceso de agente","ventana de contexto","desarrollo de software asistido por IA"],"fr":["Ralph Wiggum","développement de logiciels autonomes","outils d''IA pour le développement","boucle iterative bash","développement piloté par les spécifications","processus d''agent","fenêtre de contexte","développement de logiciels assisté par l''IA"],"de":["Ralph Wiggum","autonome Software-Entwicklung","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","iterative Bash-Schleife","spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung","Agentenprozess","Kontextfenster","KI-gestützte Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Ralph Wiggum","desenvolvimento autônomo de IA","laços de iteração","desenvolvimento orientado a especificação","contexto fresco","prevenção de transbordamento de contexto","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de IA"],"ru":["Ralph Wiggum","автономное разработки ИИ Агентов","итеративные циклы","спецификация-ориентированное развитие","свежий контекст","предотвращение переполнения контекста","инструменты разработки ИИ"],"ar":["رالف وايغوم","برمجة البرمجيات الذكية ذاتية التشغيل","الحلقات التكرارية","التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات","سياق جديد","منع 溢出 السياق","أدوات تطوير الوكلاء الذكية"]}},"owner":"fstandhartinger","repo":"ralph-wiggum","repoPath":"fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.286Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph-wiggum","description":"Autonomous AI coding with spec-driven development. Implements Geoffrey Huntleys iterative bash loop methodology where agents work through specs one at a time, outputting a completion signal only when acceptance criteria are 100% met.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Ralph Wiggum\n\n> Autonomous AI coding with spec-driven development\n\n## What is Ralph Wiggum?\n\nRalph Wiggum combines **Geoffrey Huntley''s iterative bash loop** with **spec-driven development** for fully autonomous AI-assisted software development.\n\nThe key insight: **Fresh context each iteration**. Each loop starts a new agent process with a clean context window, preventing context overflow and degradation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse Ralph Wiggum when:\n\n- You have multiple specifications/fe","body":"# Ralph Wiggum\n\n> Autonomous AI coding with spec-driven development\n\n## What is Ralph Wiggum?\n\nRalph Wiggum combines **Geoffrey Huntley''s iterative bash loop** with **spec-driven development** for fully autonomous AI-assisted software development.\n\nThe key insight: **Fresh context each iteration**. Each loop starts a new agent process with a clean context window, preventing context overflow and degradation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse Ralph Wiggum when:\n\n- You have multiple specifications/features to implement\n- You want the AI to work autonomously through tasks\n- You need consistent, verifiable completion of acceptance criteria\n- You want to avoid context window problems in long sessions\n\n## How It Works\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     RALPH LOOP                              │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Loop 1: Pick spec A → Implement → Test → Commit → DONE    │\n│  Loop 2: Pick spec B → Implement → Test → Commit → DONE    │\n│  Loop 3: Pick spec C → Implement → Test → Commit → DONE    │\n│  ...                                                        │\n│                                                             │\n│  Each iteration = Fresh context window                      │\n│  Shared state = Files on disk (specs, plan, history)        │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Installation\n\n### Quick Install (via Skill Installers)\n\n```bash\n# Using Vercel''s add-skill\nnpx add-skill fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum\n\n# Using OpenSkills\nopenskills install fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum\n```\n\n### Full Setup (Recommended)\n\nFor full Ralph Wiggum setup with constitution and interview:\n\n```bash\n# Tell your AI agent:\n\"Set up Ralph Wiggum using https://github.com/fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum\"\n```\n\nThe agent will guide you through a **lightweight, pleasant setup**:\n\n1. **Quick Setup** (~1 min) — Create directories, download scripts\n2. **Project Interview** — Focus on your **vision and goals** (not tech details)\n3. **Constitution** — Create a guiding document for all sessions\n4. **Next Steps** — Clear guidance on creating specs and starting Ralph\n\nFor existing projects, the agent detects your tech stack automatically. The interview prioritizes understanding *what you''re building and why*.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Fresh Context Each Loop\n\nEach iteration of the Ralph loop starts a new AI agent process. This means:\n- No context window overflow\n- No degradation over time\n- Clean slate for each task\n\n### 2. Shared State on Disk\n\nState persists between loops via files:\n- `specs/` — Feature specifications with acceptance criteria\n- `ralph_history.txt` — Log of breakthroughs, blockers, learnings\n- `IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` — Optional detailed task breakdown\n\n### 3. Completion Signal\n\nThe agent outputs `<promise>DONE</promise>` **ONLY** when:\n- All acceptance criteria are verified\n- Tests pass\n- Changes are committed and pushed\n\nThe bash loop checks for this phrase. If not found, it retries.\n\n### 4. Backpressure via Tests\n\nTests, lints, and builds act as guardrails. The agent must fix issues before outputting the completion signal.\n\n## Usage\n\n### Creating Specifications\n\n**The key to success:** Each spec needs **clear, testable acceptance criteria**. This is what tells Ralph when a task is truly \"done.\"\n\n```markdown\n# Feature: User Authentication\n\n## Requirements\n- OAuth login with Google\n- Session management\n- Logout functionality\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] User can log in with Google\n- [ ] Session persists across page reloads\n- [ ] User can log out\n- [ ] Tests pass\n\n**Output when complete:** `<promise>DONE</promise>`\n```\n\n**Good criteria:** \"User can log in with Google and session persists\"\n**Bad criteria:** \"Auth works correctly\"\n\nThe more specific your acceptance criteria, the better Ralph performs.\n\n### Running the Loop\n\n```bash\n# Start building (Claude Code)\n./scripts/ralph-loop.sh\n\n# With max iterations\n./scripts/ralph-loop.sh 20\n\n# Using Codex CLI\n./scripts/ralph-loop-codex.sh\n```\n\n### Logging (All Output Captured)\n\nEvery loop run writes **all output** to log files in `logs/`:\n\n- **Session log:** `logs/ralph_*_session_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.log` (entire run, including CLI output)\n- **Iteration logs:** `logs/ralph_*_iter_N_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS.log` (per-iteration CLI output)\n- **Codex last message:** `logs/ralph_codex_output_iter_N_*.txt`\n\n## Two Modes\n\n| Mode | Purpose | Command |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| **build** (default) | Pick spec, implement, test, commit | `./scripts/ralph-loop.sh` |\n| **plan** (optional) | Create detailed task breakdown | `./scripts/ralph-loop.sh plan` |\n\n## Key Principles\n\n### Let Ralph Ralph\n\nTrust the AI to self-identify, self-correct, and self-improve. Observe patterns and adjust prompts.\n\n### YOLO Mode\n\nFor Ralph to work effectively, enable full autonomy:\n- Claude Code: `--dangerously-skip-permissions`\n- Codex: `--dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox`\n\n⚠️ **Use at your own risk.** Only in sandboxed environments.\n\n## Links\n\n- **GitHub:** https://github.com/fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum\n- **Website:** https://ralph-wiggum.ai\n- **Original methodology:** [Geoffrey Huntley''s how-to-ralph-wiggum](https://github.com/ghuntley/how-to-ralph-wiggum)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:59.816Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous AI Agents needing spec-driven development for fully autonomous AI-assisted software development.","zh":"非常适合需要基于规格驱动开发的自主AI代理进行完全自主AI辅助软件开发。","ja":"規格駆動開発を必要とする自律的なAIエージェントが完全に自律的なAIアシストソフトウェア開発を行うのに最適です。","ko":"规格 주도 개발을 필요로 하는 자율적인 AI 에이전트가 완전히 자율적인 AI 보조 소프트웨어 개발을 위해 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Autónomos que necesitan desarrollo basado en especificaciones para el desarrollo de software asistido por IA completamente autónomo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA autonomes ayant besoin d''un développement basé sur des spécifications pour le développement de logiciels entièrement autonomes assistés par l''IA.","de":"Perfekt für autonome KI-Agenten, die spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung für vollständig autonome KI-gestützte Softwareentwicklung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Autônomos que necessitam de desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações para desenvolvimento de software de IA assistida totalmente autônomo.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов ИИ, которым требуется разработка, управляемая спецификациями, для полностью автономного разработки программного обеспечения с помощью ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي المستقلة التي تحتاج إلى تطوير مدفوع بالمواصفات لبرامج البرامج المستقلة الكاملة التي تساعد على الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Geoffrey Huntley''s iterative bash loop with spec-driven development, providing fresh context each iteration and preventing context overflow and degradation, utilizing spec-driven development for autonomous AI coding.","zh":"赋予代理利用Geoffrey Huntley的迭代bash循环和规格驱动开发，提供每次迭代的新上下文，并防止上下文溢出和退化，利用规格驱动开发进行自主AI编码。","ja":"Geoffrey Huntleyのイテレーティブなbashループと規格駆動開発を利用してエージェントに力を与え、各イテレーションで新しいコンテキストを提供し、コンテキストオーバーフローと劣化を防ぎ、規格駆動開発を使用して自律的なAIコーディングを行う。","ko":"Geoffrey Huntley의 반복 bash 루프와 규격 주도 개발을 사용하여 에이전트에力を 부여하고, 각 반복에서 새로운 컨텍스트를 제공하고, 컨텍스트 오버플로와 저하를 방지하며, 규격 주도 개발을 사용하여 자율적인 AI 코딩을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar el bucle iterativo de Geoffrey Huntley con desarrollo basado en especificaciones, proporcionando un contexto fresco en cada iteración y evitando el desbordamiento y la degradación del contexto, utilizando el desarrollo basado en especificaciones para la codificación autónoma de la IA.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser la boucle itérative de Geoffrey Huntley avec un développement basé sur des spécifications, fournissant un contexte frais à chaque itération et empêchant le débordement et la dégradation du contexte, en utilisant le développement basé sur des spécifications pour la codification autonome de l''IA.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Geoffrey Huntleys iterativen Bash-Loop mit spezifikationsgetriebener Entwicklung zu nutzen, indem in jeder Iteration ein frischer Kontext bereitgestellt und ein Kontextüberlauf sowie eine Kontextverschlechterung verhindert werden, wobei spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung für autonomes KI-Coding verwendet wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes a aproveitarem o loop iterativo bash de Geoffrey Huntley com desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações, fornecendo novo contexto a cada iteração e prevenindo o transbordamento e degradação de contexto, utilizando desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações para codificação de IA autônoma.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать итеративную bash-петлю Джофри Хантли с разработкой, управляемой спецификациями, предоставляя свежий контекст на каждой итерации и предотвращая переполнение и деградацию контекста, используя разработку, управляемую спецификациями, для автономного кодирования ИИ.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استخدام حلقة الباش التكرارية لجوفري هانتلي مع التطوير الذي يوجهه المواصفات، وتوفير سياق جديد في كل تكرار ومنع انهمار السياق والتحلل، باستخدام التطوير الذي يوجهه المواصفات للترميز المستقل للذكاء الاصطناعي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating AI-assisted software development with spec-driven development","Generating fully autonomous AI code with iterative bash loops","Preventing context overflow and degradation in AI coding"],"zh":["使用规格驱动开发进行AI辅助软件开发的自动化","使用迭代bash循环生成完全自主AI代码","防止AI编码中的上下文溢出和退化"],"ja":["規格駆動開発を使用したAIアシストソフトウェア開発の自動化","イテレーティブなbashループを使用して完全に自律的なAIコードを生成する","AIコーディングにおけるコンテキストオーバーフローと劣化の防止"],"ko":["규격 주도 개발을 사용하여 AI 보조 소프트웨어 개발을 자동화하는 것","반복 bash 루프를 사용하여 완전히 자율적인 AI 코드를 생성하는 것","AI 코딩에서 컨텍스트 오버플로와 저하를 방지하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar el desarrollo de software asistido por IA con desarrollo basado en especificaciones","Generar código de IA completamente autónomo con bucles iterativos de Bash","Prevenir el desbordamiento y la degradación del contexto en la codificación de la IA"],"fr":["Automatiser le développement de logiciels assistés par l''IA avec un développement basé sur des spécifications","Générer du code de l''IA entièrement autonome avec des boucles itératives de Bash","Prévenir le débordement et la dégradation du contexte dans la codification de l''IA"],"de":["Automatisierung der KI-gestützten Softwareentwicklung mit spezifikationsgetriebener Entwicklung","Generierung vollständig autonomer KI-Code mit iterativen Bash-Loops","Verhindern von Kontextüberlauf und -verschlechterung bei der KI-Codierung"],"pt":["Automatizar o desenvolvimento de software de IA assistida com desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações","Gerar código de IA totalmente autônomo com loops bash iterativos","Prevenir o transbordamento e degradação de contexto na codificação de IA"],"ru":["Автоматизировать разработку программного обеспечения с помощью ИИ с разработкой, управляемой спецификациями","Генерировать полностью автономный код ИИ с итеративными bash-петлями","Предотвратить переполнение и деградацию контекста при кодировании ИИ"],"ar":["أتمتة تطوير برامج البرامج التي تساعد على الذكاء الاصطناعي مع التطوير الذي يوجهه المواصفات","توليد رمز الذكاء الاصطناعي المستقل الكامل مع الحلقات الباش التكرارية","منع انهمار السياق والتحلل في الترميز الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires spec-driven development setup","Context window limitations may apply"],"zh":["需要规格驱动开发设置","上下文窗口限制可能适用"],"ja":["規格駆動開発の設定が必要","コンテキストウィンドウの制限が適用される場合がある"],"ko":["규격 주도 개발 설정이 필요합니다.","컨텍스트 창 제한이 적용될 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de desarrollo basado en especificaciones","Puede aplicar limitaciones de ventana de contexto"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de développement basé sur des spécifications","Des limitations de fenêtre de contexte peuvent s''appliquer"],"de":["Erfordert spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklungseinrichtung","Kontextfensterbeschränkungen können gelten"],"pt":["Exige configuração de desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações","Pode aplicar limitações de janela de contexto"],"ru":["Требует настройки разработки, управляемой спецификациями","Могут применяться ограничения окна контекста"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد التطوير الذي يوجهه المواصفات","يمكن أن تنطبق قيود نافذة السياق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"0c870df2aa953e2663f4725856f3c2d730a58ff99bfaa3c00d0f7a4df2ea8b19","qualityScore":56}');
