INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('openakita/openakita/openakita/skills@file-manager', 'openakita/skills@file-manager', 'openakita', 'openakita', 'community', 'openakita/skills@file-manager openakita openakita community The openakita/skills@file-manager skill enables AI agents to perform various file operations, benefiting developers who need to manage files and directories programmatically. openakita/skills@file-manager 提供了一套文件和目录管理工具，包括创建、删除、移动、复制文件或目录等功能 openakita/skills@file-manager はファイルとディレクトリの管理ツールセットを提供します openakita/skills@file-manager는 파일과 디렉토리 관리 도구セット을 제공합니다 openakita/skills@file-manager es un framework de asistente de IA de código abierto que proporciona herramientas para gestionar archivos y directorios openakita/skills@file-manager est un framework d''assistant IA open source qui fournit des outils pour gérer des fichiers et des répertoires openakita/skills@file-manager ist ein Open-Source-AI-Assistenten-Framework, das Tools zur Verwaltung von Dateien und Verzeichnissen bietet O openakita/skills@file-manager é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de arquivos e diretórios que permite criar, deletar, mover e copiar arquivos com Python e CLI. ИИ Агенты openakita/skills@file-manager - это инструмент для управления файлами и директориями, который позволяет создавать, удалять, перемещать и копировать файлы с помощью Python и CLI. أداة الإدارة الملفات openakita/skills@file-manager هي أداة لتنظيم الملفات والمجلدات التي تمكن من إنشاء وحذف ونقل ونسخ الملفات باستخدام Python و CLI how to use openakita/skills@file-manager openakita/skills@file-manager setup guide file manager AI agent skills openakita/skills@file-manager vs file system managers openakita/skills@file-manager install for AI agents file operations with openakita/skills@file-manager openakita/skills@file-manager AI助手框架 文件管理工具集 Python脚本 文件操作 目录管理 AI工具 文件搜索 文件信息 Lists directory contents using the `list` command with optional recursion and pattern filtering Reads file contents with the `read` command, supporting encoding specification such as UTF-8 Writes file contents using the `write` command with optional appending Copies files with the `copy` command, specifying source and destination paths Moves or renames files using the `move` command openakita/skills@file-manager is an open-source AI assistant framework skill for managing files and directories, providing tools for creation, deletion, and manipulation.');
