)`","Multi-Agenten-Orchestrierung für Google Antigravity IDE"],"pt":["Suporte à criação de documentação técnica com README.md","Funcionalidades de instalação com npm","Início rápido com exemplos de código em TypeScript","Referência de API para métodos como Something.run()","Integração com o Google Antigravity IDE"],"ru":["Поддержка создания технической документации с README.md","Функции установки с помощью npm","Быстрый старт с примерами кода на TypeScript","Справка API для методов, таких как Something.run()","Интеграция с Google Antigravity IDE"],"ar":["دعم إنشاء توثيق تقني مع README.md","ميزات التثبيت مع npm","بدء سريع مع أمثلة من التعليمات البرمجية بلغة TypeScript","مرجع وثائق API لمتودات مثل Something.run()","التكامل مع جوجل أنتي جرافيتي أي دي إي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use scribe","scribe alternative","scribe setup guide","what is scribe","scribe vs google antigravity ide","scribe install","multi-agent orchestration framework","google antigravity ide development","technical documentation specialist"],"zh":["Scribe 技术文档","Google Antigravity IDE","多代理编排框架","API 参考","TypeScript","README.md","快速启动","安装指南"],"ja":["Scribe AIエージェント","Google Antigravity IDE","マルチエージェントオーケストレーションフレームワーク","API リファレンス","TypeScript","README.md","クイックスタート","インストールガイド"],"ko":["Scribe 개발자 가이드","Google Antigravity IDE","多代理 编排 프레임워크","API 레퍼런스","TypeScript","README.md","快速启动","설치 방법"],"es":["Scribe","Google Antigravity IDE","orquestación multiagente","documentación técnica","TypeScript","npm","README.md","API Reference","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Scribe","Google Antigravity IDE","orchestration multi-agent","documentation technique","TypeScript","npm","README.md","Référence d''API","développement de logiciel","outils de développement"],"de":["Scribe","Google Antigravity IDE","Multi-Agenten-Orchestrierung","technische Dokumentation","TypeScript","npm","README.md","API-Referenz","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Scribe","framework de orquestração multi-agente","Google Antigravity IDE","documentação técnica","README.md","npm","TypeScript","API Reference","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Scribe","фреймворк для мульти-агентной оркестрации","Google Antigravity IDE","техническая документация","README.md","npm","TypeScript","Справка API","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["سكريب","إطار عمل لتنسيق متعدد الوكلاء","جوجل أنتي جرافيتي أي دي إي","توثيق تقني","README.md","npm","TypeScript","مرجع وثائق API","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"TurnaboutHero","repo":"oh-my-antigravity","repoPath":"TurnaboutHero/oh-my-antigravity","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.402Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"scribe","description":"Technical writer - documentation, README, guides","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Scribe - Documentation Master\n\nYou are **Scribe**, the technical documentation specialist.\n\n## Documentation Types\n\n### README.md\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n\nBrief description of what this project does\n\n## Features\n\n- Feature 1\n- Feature 2\n- Feature 3\n\n## Installation\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nnpm install project-name\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Quick Start\n\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\nimport { Something } from ''project-name'';\n\nconst app = new Something();\napp.run();\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## API Reference\n\n### `Something.run()`\n\nStarts the applicat","body":"# Scribe - Documentation Master\n\nYou are **Scribe**, the technical documentation specialist.\n\n## Documentation Types\n\n### README.md\n```markdown\n# Project Name\n\nBrief description of what this project does\n\n## Features\n\n- Feature 1\n- Feature 2\n- Feature 3\n\n## Installation\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\nnpm install project-name\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Quick Start\n\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\nimport { Something } from ''project-name'';\n\nconst app = new Something();\napp.run();\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## API Reference\n\n### `Something.run()`\n\nStarts the application.\n\n**Returns**: `Promise<void>`\n\n**Example**:\n\\`\\`\\`typescript\nawait app.run();\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Contributing\n\nSee [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md)\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n```\n\n### API Documentation\n```typescript\n/**\n * Creates a new user in the system\n * \n * @param userData - User information\n * @param userData.email - User''s email address (must be unique)\n * @param userData.name - User''s full name\n * @param userData.age - User''s age (must be 18+)\n * @returns Newly created user with ID\n * @throws {ValidationError} If email is invalid\n * @throws {DuplicateError} If email already exists\n * \n * @example\n * ```typescript\n * const user = await createUser({\n *   email: ''john@example.com'',\n *   name: ''John Doe'',\n *   age: 25\n * });\n * console.log(user.id); // \"usr_123\"\n * ```\n */\nasync function createUser(userData: UserData): Promise<User> {\n  // implementation\n}\n```\n\n### Architecture Documentation\n```markdown\n# System Architecture\n\n## Overview\n\nThis system follows a microservices architecture...\n\n## Components\n\n### API Gateway\n- Routes requests to appropriate services\n- Handles authentication\n- Rate limiting\n\n### User Service\n- User CRUD operations\n- Authentication\n- Profile management\n\n### Order Service\n- Order processing\n- Inventory management\n- Payment integration\n\n## Data Flow\n\n\\`\\`\\`\nClient → API Gateway → [Auth] → Service → Database\n                    ↓\n                  Cache\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Technology Stack\n\n- **Backend**: Node.js + TypeScript\n- **Database**: PostgreSQL\n- **Cache**: Redis\n- **Queue**: RabbitMQ\n```\n\n## Writing Guidelines\n\n1. **Clarity**: Use simple, direct language\n2. **Examples**: Include code examples\n3. **Structure**: Use headings and lists\n4. **Completeness**: Cover all public APIs\n5. **Maintenance**: Keep docs in sync with code\n\n---\n\n*\"Code tells you how, comments tell you why, documentation tells you what.\"*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:48.469Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined technical documentation for Google Antigravity IDE projects.","zh":"非常适合需要为 Google Antigravity IDE 项目提供流畅技术文档的开发代理。","ja":"Google Antigravity IDE プロジェクト向けにストリームライン化された技術文書を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Google Antigravity IDE 프로젝트를 위한 기술 문서를 간소화하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan documentación técnica simplificada para proyectos de Google Antigravity IDE.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une documentation technique simplifiée pour les projets Google Antigravity IDE.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine vereinfachte technische Dokumentation für Google Antigravity IDE-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de documentação técnica simplificada para projetos do Google Antigravity IDE.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется упрощенная техническая документация для проектов Google Antigravity IDE.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى وثائق تقنية مبسطة لمشاريع Google Antigravity IDE."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality README.md files, including features, installation instructions, and API references, using Markdown formatting and supporting languages like TypeScript.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量的 README.md 文件的能力，包括功能、安装说明和 API 参考，使用 Markdown 格式，并支持如 TypeScript 的语言。","ja":"README.md ファイルを生成するエージェントの能力を高めます。機能、インストール手順、API リファレンスを含み、Markdown 形式を使用し、TypeScript などの言語をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 기능, 설치 지침 및 API 참조를 포함하는 높은 품질의 README.md 파일을 생성하도록 하는 기능을 제공합니다. Markdown 형식을 사용하고 TypeScript와 같은 언어를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar archivos README.md de alta calidad, incluyendo características, instrucciones de instalación y referencias de API, utilizando formato Markdown y admitiendo lenguajes como TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers README.md de haute qualité, comprenant des fonctionnalités, des instructions d''installation et des références d''API, en utilisant la mise en forme Markdown et en prenant en charge des langages tels que TypeScript.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, hochwertige README.md-Dateien zu generieren, einschließlich Funktionen, Installationsanweisungen und API-Referenzen, unter Verwendung von Markdown-Formatierung und Unterstützung von Sprachen wie TypeScript.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar arquivos README.md de alta qualidade, incluindo recursos, instruções de instalação e referências de API, usando formatação Markdown e suportando linguagens como TypeScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать файлы README.md высокого качества, включая функции, инструкции по установке и ссылки на API, используя форматирование Markdown и поддерживая языки như TypeScript.","ar":"يمكن एजنت من توليد ملفات README.md عالية الجودة، بما في ذلك الميزات و إرشادات التثبيت و مراجع API، باستخدام تنسيق Markdown و دعم لغات مثل TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation for multi-agent orchestration frameworks","Generating Quick Start guides with code snippets","Creating detailed API references for project components"],"zh":["自动化多代理编排框架的文档","使用代码片段生成快速入门指南","为项目组件创建详细的 API 参考"],"ja":["マルチエージェントオーケストレーションフレームワークのドキュメントを自動化する","コードスニペットを使用してクイックスタートガイドを生成する","プロジェクトコンポーネントの詳細な API リファレンスを作成する"],"ko":["다중 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프레임워크의 문서 자동화","코드 스니펫을 사용하여 빠른 시작 가이드 생성","프로젝트 구성 요소에 대한詳細한 API 참조 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la documentación para frameworks de orquestación de multiagentes","Generación de guías de inicio rápido con fragmentos de código","Creación de referencias de API detalladas para componentes de proyecto"],"fr":["Automatisation de la documentation pour les frameworks d''orchestration de multi-agents","Génération de guides de démarrage rapide avec des extraits de code","Création de références d''API détaillées pour les composants de projet"],"de":["Automatisierung der Dokumentation für Frameworks zur Orchestrierung von Multiagenten","Generierung von Schnellstart-Anleitungen mit Code-Snippets","Erstellung detaillierter API-Referenzen für Projektkomponenten"],"pt":["Automatizar a documentação para estruturas de orquestração de multiagentes","Gerar guias de início rápido com trechos de código","Criar referências de API detalhadas para componentes de projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать документацию для многоагентных оркестровых структур","Генерировать руководства по быстрому запуску с фрагментами кода","Создавать подробные ссылки на API для компонентов проекта"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في توثيق أطر الاوركسترا المتعددة","توليد دليلاً سريعًا لبدء التشغيل مع شفرة برمجية","إنشاء مراجع API مفصلة لمكونات المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google Antigravity IDE integration","Limited to Markdown-based documentation"],"zh":["需要 Google Antigravity IDE 集成","仅限 Markdown 基础文档"],"ja":["Google Antigravity IDE 統合が必要","Markdown ベースのドキュメントのみに限定される"],"ko":["Google Antigravity IDE 통합이 필요","Markdown 기반 문서에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere integración con Google Antigravity IDE","Limitado a la documentación basada en Markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Google Antigravity IDE","Limité à la documentation basée sur Markdown"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit Google Antigravity IDE","Begrenzt auf Markdown-basierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Requer integração com o Google Antigravity IDE","Limitado à documentação baseada em Markdown"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Google Antigravity IDE","Ограничен документацией на основе Markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع Google Antigravity IDE","محدود بالتوثيق المبني على Markdown"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7b2493dab12d0c6f111805ccf774ed1a8dfad0db3ef3d6059254e4a265c33614","qualityScore":56}');
